    <briefdescription>
<para>Struct to hold space weather parameters for a specific date. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This struct contains various space weather parameters, including the Bartels Solar Rotation Number, Kp indices, Ap indices, Cp index, International Sunspot Number, and 10.7 cm Solar Radio Flux data.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Format from <ulink url="https://celestrak.org/SpaceData/SpaceWx-format.php">https://celestrak.org/SpaceData/SpaceWx-format.php</ulink> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
